/target
**/target
node_modules
dist
playwright-report
test-results
__pycache__

# Tauri regenerates these on every build
desktop/src-tauri/gen/schemas

# Vaults, backups, locks and audit logs never belong in a repo.
# (Vault locks are <vault>.kdbx.lock; Cargo.lock must stay committed.)
*.kdbx
*.kdbx.*
*.audit.jsonl
*.audit.jsonl.lock

# Synthetic interoperability fixtures only; never add a real vault here.
!crates/akm-core/tests/fixtures/kdbx3.kdbx
!crates/akm-core/tests/fixtures/kdbx40.kdbx

# Credentials and plaintext environment exports are never source files.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# Build products, crash dumps and local backups.
*.exe
*.dll
*.msi
*.pdb
*.dmp
*.bak
*.backup
*.tmp

# Raw evidence is retained locally, not silently discarded or uploaded.
# Markdown findings and safe JSON manifests remain versioned; see docs/REPOSITORY.md.
*.log
*.jsonl
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz
/docs/**/*.png
/docs/**/*.jpg
/docs/**/*.jpeg
/docs/**/*.webp
/docs/**/*.txt

# Settings preimages and process/UI recovery records stay on this computer.
**/settings-before*
**/recovery.json
**/recovery-*.json
**/*-identity.json
**/runtime-cleanup.json
**/native-diagnostics*
**/fake-ui-names*
*.bin

.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
